WEBVTT

00:01.310 --> 00:05.230
Mother, I learned that the crest on my ring from the brooch has some relation to

00:05.230 --> 00:09.230
the Ducal House of Preminger!

00:09.230 --> 00:12.450
Are you in Vienna right now , Mother?

00:12.450 --> 00:13.950
I want to hurry and see you soon...

00:14.700 --> 00:17.030
So now, we're heading off to Vienna!

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

02:09.580 --> 02:12.380
﻿Go, go, go, go!

02:14.420 --> 02:21.800
﻿Mother, If I go to the Ducal House of Preminger, I might learn something about you.

02:21.890 --> 02:26.560
﻿Please wait for me, Mother. I'll be coming to see you any day now!

02:29.730 --> 02:30.810
﻿They're so big!

02:30.810 --> 02:31.730
﻿Yeah!

02:31.730 --> 02:35.690
﻿These are definitely the biggest pyramids out of all the one's we've seen so far!

02:37.940 --> 02:39.110
﻿What's wrong?

02:39.110 --> 02:40.700
There's something inside the pyramid.

02:40.700 --> 02:42.530
﻿Huh? What's inside it?

02:42.530 --> 02:44.740
﻿The ghost of a Pharaoh~

02:45.580 --> 02:49.040
﻿The Pharaoh's curse is terrible, you know...

02:50.170 --> 02:51.710
﻿W-What's a Pharaoh?!

02:52.330 --> 02:56.880
'Pharaoh' refers to the King who once ruled over the country of Egypt.

02:56.880 --> 02:59.840
﻿It's said that pyramids were made to be their tombs.

02:59.840 --> 03:04.180
﻿And if you touch the Pharaoh's treasure that's lying besides him, you'll be cursed~!

03:01.360 --> 03:04.160
Th-Th-That's ridiculous! I'm not scared of any curse at...

03:04.180 --> 03:05.430
﻿ALL!!

03:08.100 --> 03:09.640
﻿Kennosuke's a scaredy-cat!

03:09.640 --> 03:11.690
﻿A samurai won't be taken down by any curse...!

03:22.550 --> 03:27.560
The Brooch that Vanished Into the Pyramid

03:28.040 --> 03:30.250
﻿Looking through that kaleidoscope again?

03:30.960 --> 03:32.750
﻿Ah! It's a boat!

03:32.750 --> 03:36.630
﻿Hey! Hey over there!!

03:38.710 --> 03:40.720
﻿The Dandelion Troupe, huh?

03:41.300 --> 03:44.800
﻿For Nadja to have been in a traveling entertainer group...

03:44.800 --> 03:47.600
﻿no wonder she's been going back and forth through so many countries.

03:50.270 --> 03:54.020
﻿That silly girl is waving simplemindedly, .not realizing that she can no longer run from us.

03:54.020 --> 03:56.520
﻿Hey! Hey over there!!

03:56.520 --> 03:58.940
﻿What are you waving back at her for?!

03:57.040 --> 03:58.920
Hey!

03:59.280 --> 04:00.740
I'm sorry, Boss!

04:00.740 --> 04:03.950
﻿Show some spirit! We're finally going to catch Nadja at the next town we go to!

04:03.950 --> 04:06.490
﻿A bazaar in the biggest camel market of Egypt, huh?

04:06.490 --> 04:09.790
﻿While we're out getting our goods and food, you guys can go wherever you want.

04:11.750 --> 04:14.250
﻿I got my allowance!

04:14.250 --> 04:15.460
﻿What should I buy?

04:18.210 --> 04:19.710
﻿You thieving cat!

04:21.050 --> 04:22.470
Stop being so violent, to the poor thing.

04:22.470 --> 04:25.630
﻿Huh? This has nothing to do with you.

04:25.640 --> 04:29.310
﻿This scoundrel took a bite out of one of my important merchandise!

04:29.770 --> 04:32.350
﻿Is this enough for it? The fee for the meat...

04:32.350 --> 04:34.520
﻿Well, yes, but...

04:34.520 --> 04:35.980
﻿Please take it.

04:36.860 --> 04:38.980
﻿With this, please forgive that eat.

04:41.150 --> 04:46.110
﻿All right... as long as I can receive my payment. I won't complain.

04:49.080 --> 04:50.790
﻿Now, go on!

04:55.370 --> 04:58.000
﻿Miss. Here's a gift.

05:00.500 --> 05:01.590
﻿Thank you!

05:06.680 --> 05:09.970
﻿Nadja! A guy over here said he'd let us ride a camel!

05:09.970 --> 05:11.930
﻿Oh! I want to ride one, I want to ride one!

05:20.520 --> 05:21.650
﻿Ow, ow, ow..

05:23.740 --> 05:25.570
﻿This feels so nice!

05:25.570 --> 05:28.450
﻿Kennosuke! I'm going to go take a quick ride about.

05:29.070 --> 05:31.410
﻿O-Okay...

05:33.200 --> 05:34.620
I-I ﻿can do it too...

05:51.720 --> 05:52.600
﻿Bianco!

05:52.600 --> 05:53.760
﻿Yes, Boss!

05:55.810 --> 05:56.560
﻿I did it!

05:56.600 --> 05:57.270
﻿All right!

06:02.480 --> 06:04.150
﻿Let go of me!

06:04.150 --> 06:06.070
﻿Let g—!

06:06.070 --> 06:08.030
﻿We'll let you go.

06:09.410 --> 06:12.160
﻿After we get that brooch on your chest!

06:17.410 --> 06:19.000
﻿NOO!!

06:20.420 --> 06:21.960
﻿OW!!

06:23.550 --> 06:24.630
﻿Wait!

07:34.240 --> 07:35.950
﻿Nadja!

07:35.950 --> 07:38.080
﻿It's useless to try and hide!

07:40.290 --> 07:41.250
﻿Come out!

07:41.250 --> 07:42.290
﻿Nadja!

07:46.920 --> 07:49.420
﻿Boss, isn't she over there?

07:49.420 --> 07:49.960
﻿Yeah!

07:59.560 --> 08:02.520
﻿We found you~!

08:06.400 --> 08:07.480
﻿Give it back!

08:07.480 --> 08:08.150
﻿Shut up!

08:14.610 --> 08:16.030
﻿Bye now, little girl!

08:16.030 --> 08:17.240
﻿See ya!

08:29.550 --> 08:31.420
﻿I need to do something and get it back...

08:33.130 --> 08:34.510
﻿But what can I...

08:34.510 --> 08:38.140
﻿I wonder if now we're going to be stuck in here and become mummies...?

08:40.810 --> 08:44.270
﻿Back then, when I pushed the wall, it spun around.

08:45.770 --> 08:48.190
﻿It could be that this room has the same kind of trick somewhere!

08:49.400 --> 08:50.730
﻿All right...!

08:51.190 --> 08:53.740
﻿Shall I teach you how to get out of this room?

08:54.450 --> 08:55.740
﻿You know how?!

08:56.160 --> 09:00.030
﻿Yep. If you return my brooch, I'll tell you!

09:00.040 --> 09:02.370
﻿This is just some some shallow thinking of a child.

09:02.370 --> 09:05.870
﻿You're lying because you just want to get your brooch back, aren't you?

09:05.870 --> 09:10.630
﻿Do you think we adults will be tricked by some lie like that?

09:12.260 --> 09:13.760
﻿It's not a lie.

09:13.760 --> 09:16.090
﻿Let's see... how many stones do you think there are?

09:17.050 --> 09:20.430
﻿The stones that were used to build this famous Pyramid of Khufu...

09:20.430 --> 09:21.760
﻿do you know how many there are?

09:22.520 --> 09:23.770
﻿30,000!

09:23.770 --> 09:26.480
﻿Moron! There's no way. there's that little!

09:26.480 --> 09:29.480
﻿100,000! No, 300,000!

09:32.690 --> 09:34.490
﻿It's about 3,000,000.

09:35.490 --> 09:37.490
﻿So what?

09:37.490 --> 09:41.410
﻿I'm friends with an archaeologist who is doing research in Egypt.

09:41.410 --> 09:45.250
﻿He's taught me a lot about the pyramids.

09:45.250 --> 09:50.290
﻿From things like that and this and moreover, things like that.

09:51.000 --> 09:55.760
﻿So now it wouldn't be too odd for me to know the way out of here, now would it?

09:57.220 --> 10:00.010
﻿Hey! There better really be an exit in here!

10:00.010 --> 10:02.510
﻿There definitely has to be a hidden trick door somewhere.

10:04.520 --> 10:05.970
﻿This gap!

10:07.350 --> 10:08.210
I-It opened!

10:08.210 --> 10:08.920
Amazing!

10:09.650 --> 10:12.860
﻿Now, I've fulfilled the promise Give me back my brooch!

10:12.860 --> 10:14.570
﻿What are you talking about?

10:14.570 --> 10:16.610
﻿Yeah, I don't have a clue what you're talking about.

10:16.610 --> 10:19.150
﻿Hey! That's not fair!

10:22.260 --> 10:23.100
Geez!

10:23.120 --> 10:26.410
﻿If you can guide us to the exit, we might give your brooch back.

10:28.000 --> 10:29.670
﻿Light!

10:36.920 --> 10:38.970
﻿It's a mountain of gold!

10:39.510 --> 10:43.430
﻿This is too strange... to find the pyramid's treasure this easily...

10:44.310 --> 10:49.350
﻿A golden sarcophagus... could this possibly be... the Pharaoh's coffin?!

10:49.350 --> 10:51.650
Boss, with this, we're...

10:51.650 --> 10:54.310
﻿Rich!

10:54.320 --> 10:55.650
﻿Don't!

10:55.650 --> 10:59.530
﻿This is the tomb of the Pharaoh! If you steal his treasure, you'll be cursed!

10:59.530 --> 11:02.780
﻿That's ridiculous! Saying things like that in an era where humans can now fly in the sky!

11:02.780 --> 11:07.290
﻿As if curses exist! You're a hindrance! Let go!

11:09.250 --> 11:11.750
﻿Let's dig in!

11:19.550 --> 11:20.910
﻿W-What the?

11:20.910 --> 11:21.820
An earthquake?

11:55.290 --> 11:58.670
﻿The Pharaoh's angry! Get away from the treasure!

11:59.050 --> 12:00.420
﻿N-No!

12:01.090 --> 12:03.430
﻿This is ours! We're not going to leave it!

12:10.270 --> 12:14.390
﻿GET A GRIP! Don't blame me if you get cursed and turn into mummies!

12:14.400 --> 12:15.190
Get cursed?!

12:15.190 --> 12:15.900
﻿Turned into mummies?!

12:20.990 --> 12:22.400
﻿I-It's calmed down...

12:29.290 --> 12:30.540
﻿Geez..

12:32.710 --> 12:35.000
﻿Excuse us for being so loud.

12:36.830 --> 12:38.340
﻿Wait up!

12:43.010 --> 12:45.970
﻿Boss, I'm thirsty...

12:45.970 --> 12:47.930
﻿It's because you were running around in delirium...

12:47.930 --> 12:50.140
﻿I can't last any longer!

12:50.140 --> 12:52.350
﻿I'm thirsty too! Just deal with it!

12:52.350 --> 12:56.650
﻿Ah! The orange I got in the bazaar. I completely forgot about it.

13:02.650 --> 13:05.820
﻿You hold down Nadja. I'll steal the orange.

13:05.820 --> 13:09.320
﻿You're probably planning to eat it all by yourself, aren't you!

13:09.330 --> 13:12.740
﻿Moron! Do you really think I'd do something petty like that?

13:14.000 --> 13:15.750
﻿Shall I give you guys the orange?

13:17.540 --> 13:18.130
﻿Here.

13:19.000 --> 13:20.130
Is it r﻿eally all right?!

13:21.050 --> 13:23.340
﻿But in exchange for it, give me my brooch back’

13:23.880 --> 13:27.680
﻿You stupid girl! Even if you don't give it to us, we can just steal what we want!

13:27.680 --> 13:30.470
﻿You stand no chance of winning against two physically fit adults!

13:32.100 --> 13:34.220
﻿If you don't want to give it back, that's fine too.

13:35.020 --> 13:36.850
﻿Because I'll just crush this orange

13:38.650 --> 13:42.150
﻿You will return my brooch, won't you?!

13:42.530 --> 13:45.610
﻿Ahh!! Full power!!

13:49.320 --> 13:50.870
﻿It's so good!

13:50.870 --> 13:52.780
﻿Three pieces to each of us, huh?

13:52.790 --> 13:56.870
﻿But Boss, do you think it was really okay to give back her brooch?

13:56.870 --> 14:00.250
﻿It's fine. We can just steal it again sometime later, right?

14:00.250 --> 14:02.210
I ﻿see! As expected of you, Boss!

14:02.210 --> 14:05.670
﻿You two! You know about my Mother, don't you?

14:06.380 --> 14:07.420
﻿I'm afraid not!

14:07.470 --> 14:10.800
﻿Then why are you trying to steal my Mother's brooch?!

14:10.800 --> 14:13.310
﻿As if we'll tell you that!

14:14.060 --> 14:16.390
﻿We were asked to by that person.

14:16.390 --> 14:20.230
﻿He told us that if we stole your brooch, we'd get a huge payment.

14:20.230 --> 14:22.480
﻿MORON! What are you telling her?!

14:22.480 --> 14:25.320
﻿But... she gave me more orange slices to eat.

14:26.190 --> 14:27.990
﻿Who's "that person"?

14:27.990 --> 14:29.700
﻿Who knows? Let's go.

14:29.700 --> 14:30.700
﻿Yes, Boss.

14:35.120 --> 14:38.620
﻿There's someone who thinks of me as an obstacle to them, isn't there?

14:40.670 --> 14:44.000
﻿Who is that? Why am I thought of as an obstacle to them?

14:45.340 --> 14:50.260
﻿Is it because I'm related to Vienna's Ducal House of Preminger?!

14:50.260 --> 14:52.180
﻿How do you know tha—?!

14:52.180 --> 14:56.100
﻿Don't say things not needed to be said! She'll find out she's related to them!

14:56.100 --> 14:59.140
﻿who is it? Who thinks I'm—

14:59.810 --> 15:04.610
﻿Quiet down! If you make any more idle chatter like this, you'll pay for it!

15:05.070 --> 15:06.730
﻿Where's my Mother?

15:12.570 --> 15:16.700
﻿How can you push yourself so hard for a Mother you've never even seen?

15:17.870 --> 15:22.170
﻿It's because I've never even seen her that I want to see her! Even if it's just a glance.

15:22.790 --> 15:25.710
﻿Are Mothers really all that great?

15:25.710 --> 15:28.050
﻿What's your mother like?

15:28.050 --> 15:29.260
﻿That's...

15:29.840 --> 15:32.590
﻿That aside, can't you find the exit already?!

15:32.590 --> 15:36.560
﻿If we continue like this and can't find the exit, could it be we'll turn into mumm—

15:36.560 --> 15:39.060
﻿It'll be fine! It will be!

15:39.060 --> 15:41.520
I ﻿won't die until I see my Mother!

15:42.150 --> 15:43.980
﻿Your Mother, huh?

15:49.360 --> 15:51.240
﻿SKELETONS?!

15:52.910 --> 15:56.370
﻿I-It's over for us! We won't be able to get out of here!

15:56.370 --> 15:58.990
﻿We're all going to become skeletons just like they did!

15:59.750 --> 16:02.710
﻿Take a good look... everyone's become mummies!

16:02.750 --> 16:04.000
﻿Stop it!!

16:04.040 --> 16:05.960
﻿Boss, you're going to be a thick-boned mummy!

16:05.960 --> 16:06.920
﻿I told you to stop it!

16:07.210 --> 16:09.960
﻿And Nadja will be a thin, weak-boned mummy!

16:09.960 --> 16:11.880
I ﻿won't become any mummy!

16:12.380 --> 16:16.850
﻿If we give up, it's the end'! There's an exit! We re definitely going to get out of here!

16:16.850 --> 16:18.600
﻿P-Promising words...

16:18.600 --> 16:20.350
﻿Y-You're not scared?

16:20.350 --> 16:26.690
﻿Of course I am! But some mere skeletons won't pull me away from my path!

16:26.690 --> 16:30.650
﻿I'm going to get out of here, and definitely meet my mother!

16:36.910 --> 16:39.580
﻿Be careful over there. The ground's loose.

16:39.580 --> 16:40.910
﻿Yes!

16:40.910 --> 16:43.250
﻿What are you answering her so obediently for?!

16:43.250 --> 16:45.370
﻿She sounds reliable right now...

16:45.370 --> 16:47.210
﻿Really, you're just...

16:47.250 --> 16:48.710
﻿Quit chattering.

16:48.710 --> 16:51.250
﻿That's right! If you let your guard down, you'll fall!

16:52.590 --> 16:53.720
﻿Boss!

17:02.850 --> 17:03.810
﻿Let go of me!

17:03.810 --> 17:06.020
﻿It's impossible to pull me up with a girl's strength.

17:06.020 --> 17:08.650
﻿Even so, I can't let you go!

17:19.620 --> 17:20.830
﻿God!!

17:21.490 --> 17:23.410
I ﻿won't let us die like this!

17:38.840 --> 17:40.930
﻿Oh! Flat ground!

18:01.080 --> 18:02.030
﻿We're alive..

18:02.790 --> 18:04.830
﻿We're alive!

18:04.830 --> 18:05.500
﻿Yeah!

18:05.500 --> 18:07.160
﻿We're alive!

18:07.160 --> 18:11.170
﻿Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

18:14.380 --> 18:17.300
﻿Nadja... back then, you didn't let go of my hand.

18:17.300 --> 18:20.340
﻿We're trying to steal your brooch, you know.

18:20.340 --> 18:23.970
﻿That's true, but I couldn't have let go of your hands back there.

18:25.390 --> 18:26.470
﻿Your hand's bleeding.

18:27.140 --> 18:30.810
﻿And in the end, thanks to what you did, we're all still alive right now.

18:31.480 --> 18:32.730
﻿Now we're even.

18:32.730 --> 18:34.730
﻿You sure are kind, Nadja.

18:36.360 --> 18:42.990
﻿I remember when our Mother used to nurse our injuries like this when we were little.

18:42.990 --> 18:46.580
﻿She was such a kind Mother... we loved her.

18:46.580 --> 18:47.700
﻿Loved her?

18:47.710 --> 18:49.710
﻿Five years ago..

18:49.710 --> 18:51.750
﻿Ah, I'm sorry ...

18:51.750 --> 18:57.050
﻿No, it's all right. But there are times when I think, I'd sure like to see her again.

18:57.050 --> 19:02.090
﻿That's why we can really understand the feelings of you wanting to see your Mother.

19:02.970 --> 19:06.430
﻿Please... tell me about my Mother.

19:06.430 --> 19:09.930
﻿We were only told to take your brooch from you.

19:09.940 --> 19:12.600
﻿We weren't told a thing about your Mother.

19:12.600 --> 19:13.460
I see...

19:14.230 --> 19:17.730
﻿I know! We'll do some investigating on your Mother for you!

19:19.860 --> 19:23.030
﻿We're the great detectives, Bianco...

19:23.030 --> 19:24.120
﻿And Rosso!

19:24.120 --> 19:28.580
﻿If it's us, something like finding your Mother's whereabouts is a piece of cake!

19:28.580 --> 19:29.410
Rosso...

19:29.410 --> 19:30.750
﻿and Bianco..

19:30.750 --> 19:32.080
﻿will take care of it for you!

19:32.080 --> 19:33.920
﻿Yeah! Thanks a lot!

19:33.920 --> 19:36.840
﻿All right! Let's combine all of our strengths and get out of here!

19:36.840 --> 19:38.050
﻿Yeah!

19:40.840 --> 19:41.930
﻿A-A cat?!

19:41.930 --> 19:44.260
﻿Why is there a cat in the pyramid?

19:44.260 --> 19:46.260
﻿You're the cat I saw in the bazaar...

19:47.890 --> 19:49.430
﻿You're telling me to follow you?

19:51.230 --> 19:51.810
﻿Let's go.

19:51.810 --> 19:52.440
﻿Yeah.

19:58.320 --> 20:01.400
﻿Could it be that you've come here to save me?

20:02.910 --> 20:03.860
﻿Nadja.

20:05.990 --> 20:07.490
﻿It's light!

20:16.500 --> 20:18.960
﻿W-We got out, Boss!

20:18.960 --> 20:20.920
﻿Thank you, kitty!

20:24.550 --> 20:29.890
﻿"The greatest God of Egypt, the Sun God Ra is said to live in cats and they are worshiped as Gods."

20:30.310 --> 20:33.890
﻿What Christian said might really be true.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.600
﻿Nadja.

20:35.600 --> 20:37.650
﻿You really are something else.

20:37.650 --> 20:40.610
﻿And thanks to you we were saved too. Thank’ you.

20:40.610 --> 20:42.030
﻿You're welcome.

20:44.450 --> 20:46.160
﻿Umm... you can let go...

20:46.660 --> 20:48.320
﻿Yeah... should we...

20:48.330 --> 20:49.330
﻿Get going already?

20:53.750 --> 20:55.250
﻿You foolish girl!

20:55.830 --> 20:59.540
﻿My Mother is in good health! She's doing great!

20:59.550 --> 21:02.260
﻿Not only that, we're also NOT REAL BROTHERS’

21:02.260 --> 21:03.550
﻿You fooled me, didn't you?!

21:05.300 --> 21:07.680
﻿You're the fool for being fooled like that.

21:10.470 --> 21:11.850
﻿Give it back!

21:11.850 --> 21:16.560
